# Dependencies

When adding a new Python package:

1. Add to `requirements.txt` (with version pin if needed)
2. Add to `pyproject.toml` under `[project]` or `[project.optional-dependencies]` if dev-only
3. Run `.venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt` (or `pip install -e ".[dev]"` for dev deps)

Keep both files in sync so installs are reproducible.
